  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water, Sanitation and Hygiene (One WASH) Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the implementation of the Government of Ethiopia (GoE) One WaSH National Programme (OWN &#x2013;P) over five years (2013/14 &#x2013; 2017/18) to increase the number of people in rural and small/medium towns using improved sources of water and sanitation facilities. This will benefit additional 1.7 million people and improve access to clean water, sanitation and hygiene facilities. This will contribute towards the MDG target by halving the proportion of people without sustainable access to safe drinking water and basic sanitation and will result in improved household health and socio-economic status of 2.8 million people by 2018.</narrative>
  </description>
